  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNoFramesReShade">In the game, open the ReShade overlay with Home and check that NR is on in the AMD Neural Rendering panel.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNoFramesOpti">In the game, turn on DLSS, FSR or XeSS, then press Insert, open the Neural tab and turn on Enable NR.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionNotLoadedHint">ReShade.log in the game folder says which folder ReShade searched for add-ons. Report a problem packs it with the rest.</sys:String>
  <sys:String x:Key="Str.SessionReportHint">Report a problem packs these logs into one file to share on Discord.</sys:String>
